  "title": "eToro Deepens Its Connection With Retail Investors Through New Shareholder Engagement Initiative in Partnership with Stockperks",
  "summary": "New York – February 2, 2026 – eToro Group Ltd. (“eToro”) (NASDAQ: ETOR), the social investing platform, today announced a new shareholder engagement initiative in partnership with Stockperks. This initiative demonstrates eToro’s long-standing belief that retail investors are not just participants in the market, but partners in building a more open and inclusive financial system.…",
